{"case_id": "p6s-0103", "execution_state": "pending_not_executed", "failure_bucket": "not_executed", "human_decision": "", "human_notes": "", "human_reviewed_at": "", "human_reviewer": "", "judge_confidence": null, "judge_reasons": {"answer_correctness": null, "citation_correctness": null, "completeness": null, "faithfulness": null, "no_answer_behavior": null}, "question": "安装馈线密封窗时，应执行哪些操作步骤？", "question_type": "procedure", "rag_answer": null, "reference_evidence": [{"chunk_id": "fe0efc14933cd5d787519744", "excerpt": "工作内容：1、安装抗震加固设施：量裁、预制加固件、划线定位、安装； 2、安装加固吊挂、支撑铁架：开箱检验、清洁搬运、安装、加固、清理现场； 3、安装馈线密封窗：开箱检验、清洁搬运、安装加固、密封处理、清理现场； 4、开挖、打穿楼墙洞：确定位置、开挖或打穿墙洞、抹水泥恢复； 5、封堵电缆洞：制作防火隔板、封堵等。"}], "retrieved_chunk_ids": [], "silver_reference": "开箱检验、清洁搬运、安装加固、密封处理、清理现场", "source_ambiguity": false, "trace_file": "D:\\AgentAIProgect\\RAG\\p6-silver-e2e-500\\runs\\p6-e2e-run-01\\cases\\p6s-0103.json", "unanswerable_provisional": false}
{"case_id": "p6s-0108", "execution_state": "pending_not_executed", "failure_bucket": "not_executed", "human_decision": "", "human_notes": "", "human_reviewed_at": "", "human_reviewer": "", "judge_confidence": null, "judge_reasons": {"answer_correctness": null, "citation_correctness": null, "completeness": null, "faithfulness": null, "no_answer_behavior": null}, "question": "在2.5G非对称模式下，光路由上行光口的发送光功率范围是多少？", "question_type": "procedure", "rag_answer": null, "reference_evidence": [{"chunk_id": "acbdb12c2a62c12fe9787ef7", "excerpt": "为满足部分光网关和光路由不加链路衰减，直连使用需求，光路由上行光口链路预算 等级可参考Ra 等级，要求发送光功率范围-4~0dBm，接收光功率范围为-22~0dBm，最大 光链路损耗不超过18dB。实际使用中需要保证光路由接收光功率在饱和功率值和接收灵 敏度之间。 2.5G 对称模式的光路由上行光口功率要求应参考2.5G 非对称模式的要求。"}], "retrieved_chunk_ids": [], "silver_reference": "发送光功率范围-4~0dBm", "source_ambiguity": false, "trace_file": "D:\\AgentAIProgect\\RAG\\p6-silver-e2e-500\\runs\\p6-e2e-run-01\\cases\\p6s-0108.json", "unanswerable_provisional": false}
